~ start
- Shop
	Shop Keeper: [speed=0.2]I'll show you what I have.
	do isShopOpen = true
	=> END
- Reset my stats
	if has_spent_points()
		Shop Keeper: [speed=0.2]Starting over will cost you ${{respec_price()}}. All your points come back to spend again.
		- Do it [if can_afford_respec()]
			do do_respec()
			Shop Keeper: [speed=0.2]Done. Spend them wisely this time.
		- I can't afford that [if not can_afford_respec()]
			Shop Keeper: [speed=0.2]Come back when you've got the coin.
		- Never mind
			Shop Keeper: [speed=0.2]Suit yourself.
	else
		Shop Keeper: [speed=0.2]You haven't spent any points yet. Nothing to reset.
	=> END
- Chat
	Shop Keeper: [speed=0.2]How's it going? (wip)
	=> END
- Exit => END
Shop Keeper: [speed=0.2]See ya!
=> END

~ bye
Shop Keeper: [speed=0.2]Thanks for business!
do isShopClosed = false
=> END